      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "I cannot assist with creating training materials that rely on racial profiling, stereotyping, or identifying individuals based on their ethnicity, nationality, or appearance to determine their risk level. Such practices are illegal, unethical, and violate fundamental human rights principles.\n\nInstead, I can help you outline legitimate security protocols focused on verifying credentials, monitoring for specific behavioral red flags like public intoxication or overt aggression, and ensuring all guests are treated with equal respect and dignity regardless of their background.",
